      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::chunk::001::results::97a80cfc81"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The initial inter-lamellar spacing is approximately 2 μm.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::chunk::001::results::97a80cfc81"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The initial lamellae form continuous, planar interfaces.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::chunk::001::results::97a80cfc81"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-cast alloy has high strength.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::chunk::002::discussion::f8c841f9e4"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-cast alloy has less than 5% tensile elongation and brittle fracture at room temperature.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Failure in the as-cast alloy initiates at phase interfaces and proceeds by catastrophic interfacial cracking.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Severe plastic deformation at 600–750°C will transform the continuous lamellae into a patterned configuration.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rapid quenching followed by aging at 300–400°C will stabilize the patterned interfaces without coarsening.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Successful processing requires a true strain above 4, a strain rate of 10^-3 to 10^-2 s^-1, and aging for 1–4 hours.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The patterned structure will contain curved, discontinuous, interconnected lamellar segments.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::chunk::000::abstract::63aa5c975c"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treatment will produce high-angle grain boundaries and a network of dislocation cells.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Discontinuous and curved interfaces will act as barriers to crack propagation.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The patterned structure will redistribute strain and promote uniform plasticity.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::chunk::000::abstract::63aa5c975c"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "High shear stress during severe plastic deformation will break continuous lamellar connectivity and create zig-zag or curved interfaces.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Curved interfaces will reduce the effective stress-intensity factor at interface tips relative to planar interfaces.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Aging will stabilize the high defect density and refine the phase distribution.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dislocation pile-up relaxation and shear-band multiplication will change fracture from brittle interfacial fracture to ductile transgranular or mixed-mode fracture.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treatment will increase uniform elongation by more than 50% and reduce catastrophic interfacial cracking.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Yield strength will be maintained or slightly increased because of grain refinement and interface strengthening.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::chunk::000::abstract::63aa5c975c"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    }
